      "quote": "this paper updates and summarizes the current evidence informing rehabilitation of patients with coVid-19 and/or describing the consequences of the disease and its treatment.",
      "reason": "The abstract explicitly states the review's objective: to update and summarize evidence on rehabilitation of COVID-19 patients and the consequences of the disease and its treatment."
    },
